==English==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|neighbor||US}}
* {{alter|en|neighba||pronunciation spelling}}
* {{alter|en|neyghbour||archaic}}
* {{alter|en|naybour|neibor|neibour|neighbore|neighboure|neyghbor|neyghbore|neyghboure||obsolete}}

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*bʰuH-}}
From {{inh|en|enm|neighebour}}, {{m|enm|neighbour}}, {{m|enm|neyghebour}}, from {{inh|en|ang|nēahġebūr|t=neighbour}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*nāhwagabūrō}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*nēhwagabūrô|t=neighbour|lit=near-dweller}}, from {{m|gem-pro|*nēhwaz|t=close, near}} + {{m|gem-pro|*gabūrô|t=dweller}}. Equivalent to {{com|en|nigh|t1=near|bower|t2=farmer|id2=farmer|nocat=1}}. 
{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|sco|nebour}}, {{m|sco|neebour}}, {{m|sco|neibour|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|yol|nipore}}, {{m|yol|nypore|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|frr|Naiber}}, {{m|frr|naibüür}}, {{m|frr|näiber|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|stq|Noaber|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|gsw|Naachpuur}}, {{m|gsw|Nochbär|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|gmw-cfr|Nohber|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|nl|nabuur|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|nds|Naber}}, {{m|nds|Nahwer|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|de|Nachbar|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|lb|Noper|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|wym|nokwer}}, {{m|wym|nökver}}, {{m|wym|nökwer|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|da,nb,nn,sv|nabo|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|fo|nábúgvi|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|is|nábúi|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|gv|naboo|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|gd|nàbaidh|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|et|naaber|t=neighbour}}, {{cog|fi|naapuri|t=neighbour}}.
{{col-bottom}}

Eclipsed non-native {{ncog|enm|prome|t=neighbour}}, borrowed from {{ncog|fro|proeme}}, {{m|fro|proime}}, {{m|fro|proisme|t=neighbour}} (<< {{m+|la|proximus|t=nearest, next}}.

===Pronunciation===
